  "title": "Perfect Thumbprint Cookies",
  "description": "These thumbprint cookies are similar to those made by Chef John&#39;s mom and can be made two different ways for melt-in-your-mouth, jam-filled shortbread.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
