  "ingredients": [
    "0.33333334326744 cup unsifted powdered sugar",
    "1 stick unsalted butter, at room temperature",
    "1 large egg yolk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.25 teaspoon fine salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon almond extract",
    "1.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar, or as needed",
    "0.5 cup fruit jam, divided",
    "1 cup powdered sugar, or as needed",
    "1 tablespoon milk, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with a silicone mat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u7nfYRzAhsLzLD0Iq_jvus1VwWY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-01-5c1e9ef58f56488da5456b3a91d48044.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1/3 cup powdered sugar and butter together in a large bowl with a rubber spatula until creamy. Add egg yolk, vanilla, salt, and almond extract; mix well. Blend in flour until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VGv2ZjGGYj5IDu4ED1RsmKwalAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-02-c9fb3cda6e194f32924ab45febcfb86e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a sorbet scoop to portion dough into 1/2-ounce (about 1 tablespoon) balls. Roll each ball in a plate of white sugar to coat; roll again between your palms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IU18ZWENRDidkWm_BUPrfBWFijY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-03-1-a3cadc9411e34140882aafafcbbb282b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place several inches apart on the prepared baking sheet. Flatten balls lightly with your fingers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1iCHL_4Do-qUS4_XAMlrZjJNGIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-04-1-fc2e1a99784245588f6d44e8d0fa9bbd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For rounder cookies with less jam, poke a well into each ball using a finger or the end of a thick wooden spoon dusted with powdered sugar. Fill wells with fruit jam. Tap the baking sheet against the counter to let jam settle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YEQ63-_ugXvIpD3l1PEJ_-f09-0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-05-b0b1d40a769c4738a61a093adf75a3b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For flatter, jammier cookies: Press thumb into each ball to make a large, shallow indentation. Spoon in jam. Tap the baking sheet against the counter to let jam settle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uw4HghHI-fOPYbPmMxnL-23g-B8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-06-89c14a35612645a58f879b69666ea588.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until light golden brown, about 15 minutes. Let cookies rest on the baking sheet for 5 minutes before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely. Dust with powdered sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vEbdoXl_9-mVOAE1QOBu0o4u0D4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-07-3dusterinframe-52607a505a22418696a30737932e7b06.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the icing: Place 1 cup powdered sugar in a small bowl. Add milk, a little at a time, until icing reaches a consistency that will hold its shape when piped. Pipe over cookies in a zigzag pattern. Let sit for 15 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R4PaxhzQ3ht5eahSHCQ_HfB9Tjs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-269703-perfect-thumbprint-cookies-VAT-step-08-bb811493713648e7b2156a0b0496a228.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269703/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
