    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make simple and soft thumbprint cookies. Start by making the cookie dough with powdered sugar and butter, as well as other ingredients like vanilla extract and flour. Once mixed, roll the dough in white sugar and onto a baking sheet. Using your thumb or the round end of a spatula, create an indention in the middle of the cookies to fill with jam. Finally, bake the cookies for 15 minutes. They’re a buttery and fun dessert to make!",
